		{"id":"header","type":"text","text":"# 1F1B 时间重叠版（2 GPU × 4 MB）\n同一个 T 内，GPU0 / GPU1 的计算可以同时发生。PP 的 Block 分配始终不变。","x":140,"y":-400,"width":1070,"height":130},
		{"id":"t1g0","type":"text","text":"**GPU0 / Stage0 · 前两层**\n\n**MB0 Forward**\n生成 `H2_MB0` 并发送到 GPU1；保存反向激活","x":140,"y":-112,"width":460,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t2g0","type":"text","text":"**GPU0 / Stage0 · 前两层**\n\n**MB1 Forward**\n生成 `H2_MB1` 并发送到 GPU1；保存反向激活","x":910,"y":-108,"width":460,"height":130,"color":"5"},
